  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2102.04 ADS worker identification information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.04 “ADS worker identification information” means the certificate number and expiration date of the certificate issued to a certified ADS worker under RSA 141-E:11, and whether the worker is designated as an experienced worker or a worker-in-training as provided in Env-A 1812.08(b).\n\nSource. #7647, eff 2-16-02 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 2100) (formerly Env-Wm 3902.04); ss by #9645, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12605, eff 9-1-18",
